title: "Human-AI Joint Decision-Making in Critical Systems: a ten-part series"
abstract: >-
  A ten-part series translating the cognitive systems engineering canon into
  design and evaluation criteria for AI decision support in critical
  infrastructure, with an accompanying explainer video and curated reference base.
